{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"stew_pot","model_identifier":"stew_pot","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## stew_pot\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 13 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.0..4.0, y -10.8..1.0, z -4.0..4.0 (size 8.0 x 11.8 x 8.0 u = 22 x 33 x 22 cm).\nStew pot: a squat black iron pot (~28 cm across) on four stubby legs, full of thick brown stew with orange carrot chunks, carried by its iron bail through the fist (or hung over a fire). Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 10.8.\n"},"description":"## stew_pot\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 13 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.0..4.0, y -10.8..1.0, z -4.0..4.0 (size 8.0 x 11.8 x 8.0 u = 22 x 33 x 22 cm).\nStew pot: a squat black iron pot (~28 cm across) on four stubby legs, full of thick brown stew with orange carrot chunks, carried by its iron bail through the fist (or hung over a fire). Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 10.8.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"pot","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,-10.0,-3.5],"to":[3.5,-4.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[14,0,21.0,6.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[21,0,28.0,6.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,7,7.0,13.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[7,7,14.0,13.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,7.0,7.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[7,0,14.0,7.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0027c1b9-cdee-5cc5-886e-72e27655691f"},{"name":"belly","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"rend